# The preview serves the College, and only the College.
#
# Vercel deploys everything it is given, so the repository's working material
# would otherwise be fetchable on the preview domain: the founding plan, the
# appointment briefs, the governance register, the editorial bible, and the
# whole archived WorldWide English College build. None of that is secret, and
# none of it belongs on the College's own address either.
#
# The build still runs — scripts/ and madinah-src/ are needed by
# `node scripts/build-madinah.js` — so they are NOT ignored. Everything below
# is material the build does not read.
archive/
docs/
tests/
sql/
.claude/
*.md
!README.md
